---
import BaseLayout from "../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact | Silva Cleaning">
  <section class="page-hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Need help before booking?</h1>
    <p>For now, the booking flow is the best way to send the details needed for recurring cleaning, move-out jobs, and larger properties.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section contact-grid reveal">
    <a class="contact-card" href="/booking"><strong>Book online</strong><span>Fastest route</span><p>Choose a service, date, property size, and access notes in one flow.</p></a>
    <div class="contact-card"><strong>Custom jobs</strong><span>Add notes during booking</span><p>Use the notes box for pets, parking, keys, priority areas, and anything unusual.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-card"><strong>Coverage</strong><span>Bristol and nearby postcodes</span><p>Include your postcode so the team can confirm local availability.</p></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>